      "content": "i mean i understand, but i'm a bit nervous about going to the er if it's just a tiny bump. i dont feel dizzy or anything, just a little achy. do you think it's really necessary to go right now if i dont have any major symptoms like vomiting or passing out? i'd rather just keep an eye on it for a few hours.",
